## Anti-Duplication Protocol

Before creating ANY function:
1. Check `naos/inventory/FUNCTION_INDEX.yaml`
2. `grep -r "def function_name" src/`
3. Inspect related tests and capability constraints in `naos/capabilities/*.yaml` when present
4. Prefer reuse or refactor; if creating a new function, justify why existing functions are insufficient

After creating new functions:
```bash
python scripts/naos_code_quality_audit.py --generate-index
make -f Makefile.naos naos-function-index-health
make -f Makefile.naos naos-test-evidence-map
make -f Makefile.naos naos-test-evidence
```

If duplicate intent is suspected, report the finding and remediation options. Do not silently merge or rewrite security, encryption, authentication, authorization, database, public API, or regulatory-control code without explicit approval.
